# DEMO: nothing here should end up in a search index.
#
# This covers the files served straight off the platform's static handler, which never
# reach the worker: public/*.html, images, robots.txt. Dynamic responses get the same
# header from src/server.ts.
#
# Nitro also generates a _headers in the build output; check after building that both the
# rules below and its /assets/* cache rule survived.
#
# Remove this file when the project goes public.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex, notranslate
